'''TL;DR''' Requires {{ItemTooltip|Berzerker}}, which does not need to be legendary. Having {{ItemTooltip|Cataclysm}} and {{ItemTooltip|Commissar's Torn Sleeve}} is also very heavily recommended.

==Introduction==
{{ClassTooltip|Oni}} converts the methodical stacking of {{ClassTooltip|Ironsoul}} and the rapid pet levelling of {{ClassTooltip|Demonologist}} into a complex powerhouse. Though slower than {{ClassTooltip|Heretic}} or {{ClassTooltip|Desolator}}, and less accessible than {{ClassTooltip|Archon}}, {{ClassTooltip|Oni}}'s high scaling makes it a strong mid-game class.

