====Void Mana Generation====
This phase can take 2-5 minutes for best results. Spend more time on this for your second burst (Emp200). 

Get as much Void Mana from {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Voidterror}} until it slows drastically. {{ItemTooltip|Collar Of Obedience}} and {{ItemTooltip|Whiplash}} are very important items decreasing {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Voidterror}}'s charge speed. As soon as you go to [[#Step_7:_Burst_Phase|Burst]] you will be on a timer since your built up Void Mana will begin to go down slowly. 

