===Step 7: Burst Phase===
Get as many mysteries as possible. If you have {{PetTooltip|Living Sin}} unlocked, use it to burst. Otherwise, {{PetTooltip|Hungerer}} is the best choice.

We won’t use {{PetTooltip|Pit Lord}} because its bonus to gains from pet experience is far too low.

Go to Berserk Stance and activate Cataclysm, buy Hellholes and upgrades, then set Furious Strike to reckless, buying Hellholes and upgrades where possible. Once Cataclysm wears off, quickly switch to [[#Step_5:_Cataclysm_Charging_Phase|Cataclysm Charging Phase]] and Defensive Stance to recharge, then back to Burst.  Repeat 2-3 times until {{SpellTooltip|spell_name=Furious Strike}} and Void Mana are too depleted. 

