===Step 8: Need more mysteries?===
Simply follow Steps 4-7 again until you have acquired enough mysteries to exile. Meditative Fury provides additional weapon charges past 1E1450 mana,so It's recommended to do at least a second burst if you get more than 1E1450mana or exile isn't short.

==Enchant Priority==
To get Enchant priority make a copy of [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1rN-1hM4csPTn9KcIcIPmHsEDNR-552syJroEFleJd-U/edit?pli=1&gid=1824407751#gid=1824407751 this spreadsheet], select the appropriate items for your total enchant range, fill the rest of the data in, input max dust and it will calculate enchant priority for you. Since it won't calculate VT levelling or Box levelling phases, for VT levelling use the Burst pet set, and for box levelling just make sure the enchants are either the minimum possible or something like -15/-20 your best item. 

==Pantheon==
Only a general guideline is offered, as the optimal distribution is highly context-dependent.
*''e500'': Altermutus > Ardourium
*''e600'': Altermutus > Procreogenus > Ardourium >= Tempoaeverum
*''e700'': Altermutus > Procreogenus > Ardourium >= Tempoaeverum > Animatealia
*''e800'': Altermutus > Procreogenus > Chaos > Ardourium >= Tempoaeverum > Animatealia
*''e900'': Cerebros (On all times) > Altermutus > Procreogenus > Chaos > Ardourium >= Tempoaeverum > Animatealia

